/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the answers you seek?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Polyaris is a single-player, first-person survival skiing game set in a post-nuclear, procedurally generated Arctic world. Survive the cold, ski through icy wastelands, find essential resources, fight enemies, and uncover the mystery of why you are the last one alive.",
